c 私下向议员推一份法案：只有可能造成超 10 亿美元损失或伤害 50 人以上时，政府才能叫停 AI 模型。有人批评门槛太高。","post":{"id":"2111212154758021624","url":"https://x.com/politico/status/2111212154758021624","author":"politico","author_name":"POLITICO","created_at":"2026-10-17T05:46+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":381563,"likes":157,"reposts":62,"replies":25},"flag":"有争议","story":{"id":"2111256690339303917","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111256690339303917"}},{"title":"Anthropic：AI 能把美国 GDP 推到 44 万亿","summary":"Anthropic 联合创始人预测，到 2030 年美国经济总量能从 30 万亿美元涨到 44 万亿。预测市场 Kalshi 押它今年上市的概率是七成。","post":{"id":"2111500047875481946","url":"https://x.com/Kalshi/status/2111500047875481946","author":"Kalshi","author_name":"Kalshi","created_at":"2026-10-18T00:50+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":215360,"likes":547,"reposts":43,"replies":73},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2111405326289563662","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111405326289563662"}},{"title":"Anthropic 内部：AI 干活时长是人的 6 倍","summary":"Anthropic 公布内部研究：今年 3 月 AI 干活时长首次超过员工，8 月达到 6 比 1。初级技术岗占比从 27% 降到 9%。","post":{"id":"2111197592285860233","url":"https://x.com/PeterMcCrory/status/2111197592285860233","author":"PeterMcCrory","author_name":"Peter McCrory","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:48+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":146422,"likes":1198,"reposts":113,"replies":59},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2111264306767462683","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111264306767462683"}}]},{"id":"ai_money","name":"AI 赚钱思路/副业案例","icon":"💡","items":[{"title":"用可灵 4.0 做广告，10 条不到 5 美元","summary":"一位海外博主说，用 AI 视频工具可灵 4.0 做了 10 条广告，总共不到 5 美元，效果已经看不出是 AI 做的。","post":{"id":"2110917624167108665","url":"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE/status/2110917624167108665","author":"ErnestoSOFTWARE","author_name":"Ernesto Lopez","created_at":"2026-10-16T10:15+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":129203,"likes":580,"reposts":175,"replies":55},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2110908926661206171","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110908926661206171"}},{"title":"投资人出主意：AI 大厂干脆收费让人“抄”","summary":"硅谷投资公司 a16z 的合伙人说，AI 大厂可以主动定价，让别的公司付钱“蒸馏”（模仿）自家模型，下游离不开你，又追不上你。","post":{"id":"2111166367894237402","url":"https://x.com/martin_casado/status/2111166367894237402","author":"martin_casado","author_name":"martin_casado","created_at":"2026-10-17T02:44+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":65769,"likes":496,"reposts":16,"replies":64},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2111216657771176086","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111216657771176086"}},{"title":"靠 AI 写软件做产品，其实还是很难","summary":"一位开发者说，用 AI“凭感觉写代码”做个好产品依然很难：要懂自己想做什么、懂用户体验，还要反复跟 AI 沟通测试。","post":{"id":"2111461254132887844","url":"https://x.com/eptwts/status/2111461254132887844","author":"eptwts","author_name":"EP","created_at":"2026-10-17T22:16+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":12273,"likes":323,"reposts":20,"replies":75},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2111420584236122211","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111420584236122211"}},{"title":".si 域名因“超级智能”谐音被炒火","summary":"域名平台 Spaceship 公布：.si 域名（英文“超级智能”缩写）挂牌量涨了 33 倍多，成交涨近 17 倍，但 46% 的成交价不到 1000 美元。","post":{"id":"2111463609641394445","url":"https://x.com/spaceship/status/2111463609641394445","author":"spaceship","author_name":"Spaceship","created_at":"2026-10-17T22:25+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":10524,"likes":252,"reposts":50,"replies":51},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2110980209772257600","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110980209772257600"}}]},{"id":"grok","name":"Grok Bot 使用小技巧","icon":"🛠️","items":[{"title":"马斯克转发：用 Grok Bot 做广告图","summary":"有人用 Grok Bot 和 Grok 的生图工具 Imagine 做出好看的广告，马斯克转发说：以后不用再看丑到“流血泪”的广告了。","post":{"id":"2111313240420737438","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111313240420737438","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:27+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2635929,"likes":8159,"reposts":1044,"replies":1288},"flag":"本人说法"},{"title":"Grok Bot 新功能：没事会主动来找你","summary":"一位用户说 Grok Bot 没人叫就主动私信他，想找点事做。查了一下，这是新功能“主动建议”（Proactive Suggestions）。","post":{"id":"2111522784438587767","url":"https://x.com/AndrewCurran_/status/2111522784438587767","author":"AndrewCurran_","author_name":"Andrew Curran","created_at":"2026